  "content": "![Primal Frontier](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1336081/description_51676466-6665-45e8-9ac8-27d2774e0614.png)\n\n## 本模组需要 **[Geckolib](https://modrinth.com/mod/geckolib)**\n本項目尚處於非常早期的階段，可能會遇到錯誤或不完整的功能！</strong></em></span></p>\n\n***\n\n### 關於 Primal Frontier\n\nPrimal Frontier 是一個旨在為主世界增添有趣且獨特遊戲玩法的模組，透過復活史前生物，並賦予牠們各自的能力與弱點。你可以選擇將牠們視為威脅，或是馴服牠們並利用其能力為自己帶來優勢！\n\n目前本模組僅包含兩種生物，但隨著模組發展，\n\n未來將加入更多具有獨特功能、用途與應用的生物。\n\n<span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><strong>觀看我們的最新影片，學習如何馴服蟻獅吧！</strong></span>\n<iframe width=\"280\" height=\"157\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/oZ_vExPoFTc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">加入 <span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><a style=\"color: #3598db;\" href=\"https://discord.com/invite/WYBvB6fWXx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Discord</span></a></span> 伺服器，以掌握最新資訊，並透過建議、投票與提問參與未來更新與開發進度的討論！</h2><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><strong>感謝每一位透過內容支持我們的玩家！</strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>劇透</summary>\n  <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/DRekrpO7Bfg\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/jXX50kTdF2I\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/agqO6Kc-LjU\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</details>\n\n\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><strong>製作人員名單：</strong></span></h1>\n\n<details>\n<summary>劇透</summary>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><hr><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>程式設計師：</strong></span></h3><pre style=\"text-align: center;\">Deemo</pre><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>動畫師：</strong></span></h3><pre style=\"text-align: center;\">Deemo</pre><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>3D美術師：</strong></span></h3><pre style=\"text-align: center;\">Deemo, duoud23, Sr.Mono</pre>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>2D美術師：\n</strong></span></h3><pre style=\"text-align: center;\">Allims2009</pre><hr><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p></div>\n\n</details>",
